  "_doc": "Config of the 3 teams for the multi-day pilot (0.210.0). Create the teams and assistants on the dashboard exactly as in this table, then paste the mandate through the Team tab > Department mandate (or PUT /teams/{id}/mandate). Not run yet. acceptance_template is NOT applied automatically: the person running the pilot sets criteria for EACH job (the Acceptance button) before approving the job; so every mandate here uses the approve or propose level, never act.",
